<view class="page"><view class="head"><view><text class="eyebrow">DEVICES</text><text class="page-title">设备状态</text></view><button class="bind" size="mini" bindtap="scan">⌗ 扫码绑定</button></view><text class="intro">设备必须在线、获得普通 GPS Fix 且相机与识别服务正常，才可开始任务。</text><view class="error-box" wx:if="{{errorMsg}}">{{errorMsg}}</view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading&&!errorMsg&&devices.length===0}}">暂无已绑定设备，扫描设备屏幕上的动态配对二维码添加。</view><view class="device-card" wx:for="{{devices}}" wx:key="device_id" data-id="{{item.device_id}}" bindtap="openDevice"><view class="device-top"><view class="device-icon">{{item.is_simulated?'V':'J'}}</view><view><text class="name">{{item.display_name}}</text><text class="id">{{item.device_id}}</text></view><text class="state state-{{item.standard_status}}">{{item.status_label}}</text></view><text class="reason" wx:if="{{!item.selectable}}">{{item.unavailable_reason}}</text><view class="meta"><text>{{item.is_simulated?'虚拟设备 · 模拟数据':'真实设备'}}</text><text>最近在线 {{item.last_seen_at||'--'}}</text></view></view><view class="skeleton" wx:if="{{loading}}"></view></view>
